*
** Released by: WEBENCH Design Center, Texas Instruments Inc.
* Part: LM5007
* Date: 7JAN2013
* Model Type: Transient
* Simulator: PSPICE
* Simulator Version: 16.2.0.s003
* EVM Order Number: AN-1298
* EVM Users Guide: SNVA073, 02MAY2004
* Datasheet: SNVS252E, 22APR2011
